label("$4$",F--A,W);
</asy>

The ratio of the area of <math>\triangle BFD</math> to the area of <math>ABCE</math> is

<cmath>\frac{36-12-12-2}{36} = \frac{10}{36} = \boxed{\textbf{(C)}\ \frac{5}{18}}</cmath>

